Jupyter Lab, set up with your course's Python packages. Notebooks, terminals
and the file browser all start in your home directory.

- If the kernel list offers a kernel named for your course, choose that one.
  The other kernel is the image's own Python and has no course packages.
- Claude Code and Codex are preinstalled. Sign in with your own account in a
  terminal.

Sessions usually start within a minute; a busy queue can take several.
